# Per-user topic permissions for the embedded broker. Keep in sync with the topics in
# HomeControlBackEnd/appsettings.json ("Devices") and the device's appSettings.json ("MqttConfig").
# Anything not listed here is denied.

# The backend listens for animation events and sends override commands.
user homecontrol-backend
topic read entrance/motion
topic read entrance/motion-triggers
topic write entrance/override
topic write entrance/motion-triggers/set

# The Raspberry Pi LED stripe device does the opposite.
user raspberry
topic read entrance/override
topic read entrance/motion-triggers/set
topic write entrance/motion
topic write entrance/motion-triggers
